{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1184658-2e-mechanical-advantages-of-renowns","id":1184658,"title":"[2E] Mechanical advantages of Renowns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-11T01:22:11-08:00","id":1184658,"title":"[2E] Mechanical advantages of Renowns","content":"As Renown usage in 2E <b>WtF </b>is a bit all over the corebook, I would want you to point me ALL advantage for having dots in particular Renown. I probably missed something, so point me where:<br /> <br /> 1. Renowns let you earn and give Gift's Facets power level, in dot's numbers.<br /> 2. Renowns are used to determine your Hunter Aspects when putting on your Prey.<br /> 3. Sum of Renowns points your Honorary Rank in Shadow Realm hierarchy of spirits.<br /> 4(?). I remeber from 1E that Renowns dots could be add to particular fitting Attribute + Skill rolls - but I could not find this rule in 2E <b>WtF</b> so I'm not sure it's still a thing.<br /> <br /> Did I missed something? Is 4th point still a thing in 2E <b>WtF</b> rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T04:22:31-08:00","id":1184690,"title":"","content":"Yo can flare it to gain extra successes equal to dots to the Skills related to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reacti