":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T00:32:44-08:00","id":1185043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1184658-2e-mechanical-advantages-of-renowns?p=1184690#post1184690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yo can flare it to gain extra successes equal to dots to the Skills related to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, how this works? Where it's mentioned in 2E corebook?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T03:59:59-08:00","id":1185084,"title":"","content":"Wyrd, buddy, I appreciate you, but Malus does have a point. The rules about flaring Renown are on p.99 just below the chart to determine Rank based on total dots, the relevant Conditions are at the end of the book. You could've just used the search engine of the pdf and type &quot;Renown&quot; or just go and read that section directly and you would have seen it by yourself. As a Storyteller that's been running a game for a while now you should have read those things. Everyone forgets things sometimes, but then that's easier solved by just opening the book and re-reading it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Plus we have the &quot;Ask a simple question&quot; thread for these kind of things